# ─── Shega desktop environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` and adjust. Values here are read at startup by the main
# process; real environment variables always take precedence.
#
# Shega account / onboarding / subscription / payment backend.
# The desktop, Shega Mobile and Shega Admin must all point at the SAME backend
# so an account shares one subscription and one business id across platforms.
#
# Resolution order in the app:
#   1. the `backend_api_url` setting (Settable at runtime from
#      Subscription → Shega Account → server field)
#   2. SHEGA_BACKEND_URL (this file / the process environment)
#   3. the built-in public testing endpoint
#
# SHEGA_BACKEND_URL=https://your-shega-backend.example.com
